        "original_id": "54ec7150-3fea-5235-8039-df70e52323ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kenneth Arnold\n- Events: World UFO Day, first widely reported UFO sighting in the United States, Roswell UFO Incident\n- Places: Mount Rainier, Washington, United States\n- Topics: unidentified flying objects\n\nFacts:\n- On June 24, 1947, aviator Kenneth Arnold claimed to see nine unusual objects flying in tandem near Mount Rainier, Washington.\n- Kenneth Arnold is best known for making what is generally considered the first widely reported unidentified flying object sighting in the United States.\n- World UFO Day marks June 24 as the date of Kenneth Arnold's widely reported unidentified flying object sighting in the United States.\n- World UFO Day marks July 2 as the commemoration of the supposed UFO crash in the 1947 Roswell UFO Incident.",
